  "body": "The `sent` column is strict BOOL and must be passed a `TRUE` or `FALSE` value, not `1` or `0` as before.\r\n\r\n```\r\n    ...x.se', 39, '@user:home-server.se', 'DEVICE-ID', 1, 5125125...\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhere the `1` should be a `TRUE` (seeing as SQLite3 uses 1 or 0 for BOOLS, these need to be type-converted).\r\n\r\n * File \"/usr/bin/synapse_port_db\", line 517, in run",
